     "groups": [
       {
         "all_of": [
           {
             "condition": "Alan is feeling blue.",
             "item": null          // the premise itself satisfies the condition
           },
           {
             "condition": "Alan turns green.",
             "item": "m_00d4a6"
           }
         ]
       }
     ]
   }
   ```

   (We use `null` for the first condition because the required belief (“Alan is blue.”) is the memory itself, and no separate candidate id from the list directly expresses that belief.)

